// AFTER HOURS — an original late-night comedy adventure for the DAWG Arcade, in the spirit of the
// classic Sierra adventures: one velvet suit, one night, too many bad decisions. All characters,
// places and jokes are original. PG-13: flirting, rejection and innuendo, nothing explicit.
//
// Two goals run side by side: get on stage at the rooftop show, and win over Nova, the sharpest
// comic in town. Do both for the best ending. Each location also carries its 3D set layout
// (set, hotspot anchors and models), which scene renderers read; the engine ignores it.

