 alone:{title:'ALONE AGAIN, NATURALLY',bonus:false,text:'The sun comes up. You walk home alone, velvet suit wrinkled, comb in paw. Somewhere a rooftop crowd is cheering for someone else. Tomorrow is another night, and so is the restart button.'}
